    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Hades\u2019 Harem</i>, you play as a mortal drawn into the realm of Hades, where the god of the underworld has imprisoned divine goddesses \u2014 Aphrodite, Athena, Isis, Freya, Amaterasu, and Kali \u2014 captivated by their heavenly beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each goddess is trapped behind a painting covered in darkness. Only by solving a classic sliding puzzle can you set her free\u2026 and receive a sensual reward in return.<br>But beware \u2014 you were not brought here by chance. Can you free them all and uncover Hades\u2019 true intentions?</p>",
